#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Durable remote Codex tasks for a local-canonical Git workflow.

The same file is used as the local orchestrator and as the server helper.  It
has no third-party Python dependencies.  User-facing commands always emit one
JSON object on stdout so the Doom Emacs frontend can parse them reliably.
"""

